# GitHub language stats (Linguist) tuning. Does NOT affect the build, tests, or CI,
# only the language breakdown bar shown on the repo page.

# The ctest fixtures under validation/ are OpenFOAM case files (meshes, dictionaries,
# reference oracles). Every one carries an Emacs "-*- C++ -*-" modeline in its header,
# so Linguist counts ~114 MB of them as C++ and drowns out the ~1.4 MB of actual CUDA
# code (the repo reads as mostly C++ / ~3% Cuda). Mark them as vendored so they are
# excluded from the stats; the real source then dominates as it should.
validation/** linguist-vendored

# Be explicit that the CUDA sources are Cuda.
*.cu  linguist-language=Cuda
*.cuh linguist-language=Cuda
